    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.A.N.K. \u2014 Balance? Account? No, Kidding!</strong><br><i>(A cooperative (1-2 players) bank employee simulator with elements of humor and horror)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new employee at <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">the official acronym is classified</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Your task</strong> is to serve clients from all corners of the universe. Deposits, loans, currency exchange, document checks \u2014 this is now your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 To earn money and keep the bank afloat, you must maintain order and uphold <strong>B.A.N.K.'s reputation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> is one of the few places offering financial services. But only clients <strong>chosen by the BOSS</strong> can enter. Check documents carefully and get rid of unwanted guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Two-player co-op:</strong> Earn money together, and one day, you might even <strong>take over B.A.N.K. with a friend!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.A.N.K. \u2014 Balance? Account? No, Kidding!</strong><br><i>(A cooperative (1-2 players) bank employee simulator with elements of humor and horror)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new employee at <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">the official acronym is classified</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Your task</strong> is to serve clients from all corners of the universe. Deposits, loans, currency exchange, document checks \u2014 this is now your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 To earn money and keep the bank afloat, you must maintain order and uphold <strong>B.A.N.K.'s reputation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> is one of the few places offering financial services. But only clients <strong>chosen by the BOSS</strong> can enter. Check documents carefully and get rid of unwanted guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Two-player co-op:</strong> Earn money together, and one day, you might even <strong>take over B.A.N.K. with a friend!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Congratulations on getting a job at B.A.N.K.! Whether alone or with a friend, serve customers and uphold B.A.N.K's reputation as you climb the career ladder and achieve success at work. It all depends on you!",
